  "full_text": "So as I contemplate whether these glasses and this hat are kosher, now that I want to, I must claim the strict Catholicism. And the question is, Terry, why are you being so, anyway, what's with the glasses and the hat? Now, I just realized something. Moses, they had to put a veil on Moses because he was so fabulous. It just dawned on me, all this shit is backwards, right? What they really mean is, when they put the veil on him, he looked badass or something. This is my veil. Fuck it. Let's just say that. This is it. It's my veil. Fuck it. I don't even have to explain. I don't even know if I look better or worse. It doesn't matter. I gotta wear the veil. Fuck it. You know?",
